<p><code>Dockerfile</code>：</p>]]></description></item><item><title>端口与容器网络</title><link>https://blog.luhg.cn/05-%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Luhong</author><guid>https://blog.luhg.cn/05-%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h1 id="端口与容器网络">端口与容器网络</h1>
<p>目标：分清“容器端口”“主机端口”和“容器服务名”，避免把数据库错误暴露到公网。</p>
<h2 id="1--p-的含义">1. <code>-p</code> 的含义</h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">docker run -p 8080:80 nginx:alpine</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>格式是：</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-text">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">主机端口:容器端口</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>访问 Linux 服务器的 <code>8080</code>，请求会被转发到容器里的 <code>80</code>。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>镜像与容器基础命令</title><link>https://blog.luhg.cn/03-%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Luhong</author><guid>https://blog.luhg.cn/03-%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h1 id="镜像与容器基础命令">镜像与容器基础命令</h1>
<p>目标：能拉取镜像、启动容器、查看日志并安全停止容器。</p>
<h2 id="1-拉取和查看镜像">1. 拉取和查看镜像</h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">docker pull nginx:alpine
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">docker image ls</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>镜像名一般是：</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-text">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">仓库/镜像名:标签
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">nginx:alpine</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>不要长期依赖 <code>latest</code>。明确写版本或稳定标签，部署结果才可重复。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>日志、资源与日常运维</title><link>https://blog.luhg.cn/09-%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E4%B8%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E8%BF%90%E7%BB%B4/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Luhong</author><guid>https://blog.luhg.cn/09-%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E4%B8%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E8%BF%90%E7%BB%B4/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h1 id="日志资源与日常运维">日志、资源与日常运维</h1>
<p>目标：知道服务异常时看什么，并避免容器无限占用 CPU、内存和磁盘。</p>
<h2 id="1-查看日志">1. 查看日志</h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">docker logs --tail <span class="m">200</span> demo-app
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">docker logs -f demo-app</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Docker 默认收集容器标准输出和标准错误。Java 应用应把主要日志输出到控制台，再由 Docker 或日志平台统一采集；不要只写进容器内部文件。</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>